{
  "message": "I’ve reviewed your second-island and reef-damage devlog: implementation remains unverified without a build, so the goal stays at risk. This is a common gap you can still fix here, but the remaining scope must fit Alex’s confirmed time. Now publish a prototype with two simple islands, tides and sailing, deferring co-op unless it already works. We’ll meet after the next sprint; I look forward to your prototype, test findings and devlog updates ;).",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Drop the trailer storyboard to leave time for the prototype and player tests.",
      "itemId": "cmvtk5cx1087enxz8u5txutxh",
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Publish a downloadable prototype with two simple islands, tides and sailing. Defer co-op unless it already works.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Have five players test the prototype. Publish their findings and the main problems in a shared document.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

